1
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:03,500
He's got an opinion
on everything, Ima.

2
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:05,467
He's like a walking calculator.

3
00:00:05,467 --> 00:00:07,400
He even calculated
how much I spent helping

4
00:00:07,400 --> 00:00:08,667
with those dentures.

5
00:00:09,267 --> 00:00:12,100
<i>Isn't it better that you
really get to know him</i>

6
00:00:12,100 --> 00:00:13,667
<i> before you get married?</i>

7
00:00:13,667 --> 00:00:16,133
<i> But let me remind you, dear.</i>

8
00:00:16,367 --> 00:00:18,367
<i> You don't have to force it.</i>

9
00:00:18,367 --> 00:00:20,133
<i> We'll get through this.</i>

10
00:00:20,133 --> 00:00:24,167
I can't just
give up on him, Ima.

11
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:26,133
What the hell?!

12
00:00:26,133 --> 00:00:28,733
[ROMANTIC MUSIC PLAYING]

13
00:00:28,733 --> 00:00:30,533
<i> Well, that's good.</i>

14
00:00:30,533 --> 00:00:32,533
<i> You two talk for a while.</i>

15
00:00:32,533 --> 00:00:34,000
<i> Alright. Bye!</i>

16
00:00:38,567 --> 00:00:39,567
[HUFFS]

17
00:00:41,133 --> 00:00:42,733
Why didn't you say anything?

18
00:00:44,167 --> 00:00:46,000
Do I have to talk
while I'm eating?

19
00:00:46,633 --> 00:00:48,467
Why didn't you look
where you're sitting?

20
00:00:55,433 --> 00:01:01,400
[KEYPAD CLICKING]

21
00:01:02,467 --> 00:01:03,533
[PHONE CHIMES]

22
00:01:05,667 --> 00:01:07,167
[PING] Have you eaten yet?

23
00:01:07,200 --> 00:01:11,167
[SOFT MUSIC PLAYING]

24
00:01:11,767 --> 00:01:15,367
[KEYPAD CLICKING]

25
00:01:15,367 --> 00:01:16,500
[PHONE CHIMES]

26
00:01:17,100 --> 00:01:23,733
[SOFT MUSIC CONTINUES]

27
00:01:38,600 --> 00:01:45,500
[SOFT MUSIC CONTINUES]

28
00:01:59,600 --> 00:02:02,433
[SOFT MUSIC CONTINUES]

29
00:02:02,433 --> 00:02:06,600
[KEYPAD CLICKING]

30
00:02:07,467 --> 00:02:08,700
[PHONE CHIMES]

31
00:02:11,167 --> 00:02:13,400
[JUNE]<i> Leftover rice
</i> is your favorite, right?

32
00:02:13,600 --> 00:02:15,367
<i> Why'd you give it to me?</i>

33
00:02:17,367 --> 00:02:21,400
[KEYPAD CLICKING]

34
00:02:22,233 --> 00:02:23,467
[PHONE CHIMES]

35
00:02:26,567 --> 00:02:33,433
[SOFT MUSIC CONTINUES]

36
00:02:48,500 --> 00:02:49,867
[KEYPAD CLICKING]

37
00:02:49,867 --> 00:02:51,833
[SHERYN]<i> I thought
</i> they hated each other.

38
00:02:51,833 --> 00:02:54,267
<i> They seem to be getting close.</i>

39
00:02:57,367 --> 00:02:58,367
[PHONE CHIMES]

40
00:02:59,767 --> 00:03:01,667
"Let's ruin Ping in June's eyes

41
00:03:01,667 --> 00:03:04,900
so she'll call off
the wedding herself."

42
00:03:04,900 --> 00:03:10,800
[STIRRING MUSIC PLAYING]
